    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "When creating a Contract Notice in Public Contracts Scotland (PCS) for a regulated procurement you will need to answer two new questions which are:",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Quickfire Guide",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "New PCS Innovation Questions",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "New PCS Innovation Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "With reference to ensuring this procurement meets the sustainable procurement duty, before carrying out this regulated procurement, have you considered how in conducting the procurement process it could promote innovation?",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "New PCS Innovation Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Are “innovative” works, supplies or services being bought?",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "New PCS Innovation Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Both of these questions are checkbox answers where you will respond with a Yes or No.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "New PCS Innovation Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Please note that these questions are not published on PCS and are used for reporting purposes only.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "New PCS Innovation Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Highlighting innovation within public sector contracts is important for a number of reasons:",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "New PCS Innovation Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "it allows organisations to report on the creation of innovative goods and services",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "New PCS Innovation Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "by reporting on innovation, it provides the potential to commercially scale opportunities",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "New PCS Innovation Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "by understanding contracts for innovative goods and services it will allow other organisations to learn and benefit from the work of others",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "New PCS Innovation Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "it highlights the Sustainable Procurement Duty to promote innovation before a regulated procurement is carried out",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "New PCS Innovation Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The next page includes information on the Research, Pilot and Innovation Register .",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "New PCS Innovation Questions"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    }
  ],
